<header class="titre-page conteneur">
  <p class="surtitre">Press</p>
  <h1>What they say <em>about Les Coltineurs</em></h1>
  <p class="chapo">Journalists, critics and guides have walked through the door of 97 avenue de Versailles. Here is what they thought. Most articles are in French.</p>
</header>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:1rem">
  <div class="conteneur etroit">
    <ol class="presse">
      {%- for a in presse %}
      <li class="presse__article">
        <p class="presse__media">{{ a.media }} <span>· {{ a.date | moisAnnee("en") }}</span></p>
        {% if a.citation %}<blockquote lang="{{ a.langue or 'fr' }}"><p>“{{ a.citation }}”</p></blockquote>{% endif %}
        <p class="presse__titre"><a href="{{ a.url }}" rel="noopener" lang="{{ a.langue or 'fr' }}">{{ a.titre }}</a>{% if a.auteur %}, by {{ a.auteur }}{% endif %}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--vert">
  <div class="conteneur etroit centre">
    <p class="surtitre">Journalists</p>
    <h2>Writing a story?</h2>
    <p>Gabin and Nicolas will be delighted to welcome you. For an interview, high-resolution photos or a visit, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.emailContact }}?subject=Press%20Les%20Coltineurs">{{ site.emailContact }}</a> or call <a href="tel:{{ site.telephoneIntl }}">+33 1 45 27 15 74</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
